monitors.message:
{{#is_alert}}
The moderation queue has exceeded 100 pending reports over the last 10 minutes. A growing backlog may delay response to user reports and degrade trust-and-safety responsiveness.

**Current value:** {{value}}
**Threshold:** 100

**Actions:**
1. Check if moderator staffing is adequate.
2. Verify the moderation API endpoints are healthy (latency / error rate).
3. Investigate whether a spam wave or bot attack is generating excessive reports.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Moderation queue approaching capacity threshold.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_alert}}
The moderation rejection rate has exceeded 80% over the last hour. While this could indicate a genuine spam wave, it may also point to overly aggressive moderation or misconfigured auto-rejection rules.

**Current value:** {{value}}%
**Threshold:** 80%

**Actions:**
1. Audit recently rejected reports for false positives.
2. Check if any automated moderation rules were recently changed.
3. Review the distribution of rejection reasons.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Rejection rate approaching threshold.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_alert}}
More than 20 moderation reports have been filed in the last 30 minutes. This may indicate a coordinated abuse campaign, spam wave, or a viral incident causing users to flood the reporting system.

**Current value:** {{value}}
**Top reason category:** {{reason_category.name}}
**Threshold:** 20 reports / 30 min

**Actions:**
1. Check the reports queue for common patterns (same reported user, same reason category).
2. Investigate whether a high-profile user or moment triggered mass reporting.
3. Consider temporary rate limiting on the report endpoint if this is a DDoS attempt.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Report volume approaching threshold.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_alert}}
More than 30 user analysis requests for dating-behaviour detection have been made in the last 30 minutes. This may be driven by automated tooling or an overly-aggressive moderator, and could add load to the database.

**Current value:** {{value}}
**Threshold:** 30 requests / 30 min

**Actions:**
1. Verify analysis requests are legitimate moderator activity.
2. Check for any automated scripts calling the endpoint excessively.
3. Consider adding per-moderator rate limiting on the analysis endpoint.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Analysis request volume approaching threshold.
{{/is_warning}}
